{"id":"c730666c3868e4e7","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence.md","title":"DTD 结构语言是上下文无关语言","display":"thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence — DTD 结构语言是上下文无关语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence","aliases":["73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence"],"display":"thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence — DTD 结构语言是上下文无关语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion]]","[[73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence]]","[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.3.4, print pp. 200–206; PDF pp. 222–228; local construction proof","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence — DTD 结构语言是上下文无关语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15d956da84593c7c\" href=\"?note=15d956da84593c7c\" title=\"73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion\">73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fa5a4ce6b6982a00\" href=\"?note=fa5a4ce6b6982a00\" title=\"73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence\">73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97562bc4aa1d6014\" href=\"?note=97562bc4aa1d6014\" title=\"73-df-cfg-generated-language\">73-df-cfg-generated-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.3.4, print pp. 200–206; PDF pp. 222–228; local construction proof"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{\\mathsf{DTD}}\">\\(G_{\\mathsf{DTD}}\\)</span> 及参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,s,C,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}\">\\(T,s,C,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}\\)</span>、重命名映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,h\">\\(j,h\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"15d956da84593c7c\" href=\"?note=15d956da84593c7c\" title=\"73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion\">73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion</a> 的同一实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma\\)</span> 为值域不交的开闭标记映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(G_{\\mathsf{DTD}})=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(G_{\\mathsf{DTD}})=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 h(a,q) 的推导按自动机路径逐个生成完整子元素，故合法树可按子树归纳展开。反向，j(a) 的首尾标记强制一个树节点，其中 h 部分给出一条从 q_a 到终态的内容路径；递归重建子树得到有效树。CFG 可能因内容自动机的多条路径有歧义，此结论不声称展开文法无歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"15d956da84593c7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"fa5a4ce6b6982a00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-regex-automaton-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-generated-language","status":"resolved","id":"97562bc4aa1d6014","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"15d956da84593c7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G_{\\mathsf{DTD}}$ 及参数 $T,s,C,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}$、重命名映射 $j,h$ 均取 [[73-df-dtd-grammar-expansion]] 的同一实例；$\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma$ 为值域不交的开闭标记映射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G_{\\mathsf{DTD}}","display":false},{"tex":"T,s,C,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}","display":false},{"tex":"j,h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl}:T\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"L(G_{\\mathsf{DTD}})=\\operatorname{DTDWords}(T,s,C,\\mathrm{op},\\mathrm{cl})\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}.","display":true}],"bytes":1647,"backlinks":[{"id":"432c4bc700976332","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-dtd-cfg-language-correspondence|DTD 结构语言是上下文无关语言]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["15d956da84593c7c","fa5a4ce6b6982a00","97562bc4aa1d6014","83639a9615c06195"]}